{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>WhatsApp推出「排定信息」功能，用戶可預設在10分鐘至14天後的指定時間傳送信息，個人及群組對話均可使用，信息內容可包括文字、相片及影片。新功能將於未來數周在全球推出。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T02:03:51.376825+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T01:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:37:26.863944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T01:57:27.458744+00:00","content_hash":"84d6710b7b43c08e9e950f0881b11483e92e0e19b2715852908f9b9b3a014d1a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}